      "beats": [
        {
          "zone": "courtyard",
          "index": 0,
          "text": "In the fictional courtyard, Nena has two questions. Malou listens and asks what she wants to clarify first.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 8600
        },
        {
          "zone": "resident",
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Malou repeats what she heard and invites Nena to correct her understanding. The resident’s information and choices matter.",
          "start_ms": 8900,
          "end_ms": 16900
        },
        {
          "zone": "map",
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Our organizer has four relationships: community, the designated health professional, barangay officials and fellow BHWs. Each has a different purpose and limit.",
          "start_ms": 17200,
          "end_ms": 30240
        },
        {
          "zone": "professional",
          "index": 3,
          "text": "The personal health question needs authorized professional guidance. Confirm the local contact; rank or a guess does not replace assessment.",
          "start_ms": 30540,
          "end_ms": 40340
        },
        {
          "zone": "support",
          "index": 4,
          "text": "Separately clarify the venue with the responsible coordinator. A fellow BHW may help with routine tasks. Resources, transport and outcomes are not guaranteed.",
          "start_ms": 40640,
          "end_ms": 53400
        },
        {
          "zone": "closing",
          "index": 5,
          "text": "Explain the four roles. Choose by the concern, give a reason and ask who is responsible. Respect the resident’s preferences and practise again.",
          "start_ms": 53700,
          "end_ms": 65100
        }
      ],
